# NextCloud + OnlyOffice Integration Rules

## Configuration Files
- [DEVELOPMENT_RULES.md](mdc:DEVELOPMENT_RULES.md) - Critical development workflow
- [docs/CURRENT_BEST_CONFIGURATIONS.md](mdc:docs/CURRENT_BEST_CONFIGURATIONS.md) - Current working configurations
