## NextCloud + OnlyOffice Specific Rules
- Never change JWT secrets without understanding the full auth flow
- Always check both NextCloud and OnlyOffice configurations
- Verify port configurations match nginx setup
- Test document editing functionality after any changes
- Check both internal and external URLs

## Current Working State
- NextCloud PDF viewer, image viewer, markdown editor: ✅ WORKING
- OnlyOffice service: ✅ Running on IPv4 (127.0.0.1:8000)
- OnlyOffice reachability from NextCloud: ❌ NOT WORKING
- JWT: Currently disabled for testing

## Key Configuration Files
- OnlyOffice: `/etc/onlyoffice/documentserver/local.json`
- NextCloud nginx: `/etc/nginx/sites-available/docs.test-collab-site.com`
- NextCloud config: `/var/www/nextcloud/config/config.php`

## IPv4 Only
- We are NOT using IPv6
- All services must bind to 127.0.0.1 (IPv4)
- Nginx proxies from 127.0.0.1:8080 to 127.0.0.1:8000